      en: ["Landmark: Baba Vida Fortress", "Location: On the banks of the Danube", "History: Ancient Bononia", "Religion: St. Demetrius Cathedral", "Transport: Danube Bridge 2 to Romania", "Culture: Historic Synagogue"],
